What are Steam Eye Masks?
Steam eye masks are self-heating therapeutic products that relieve eye strain, fatigue, and dryness through moist heat therapy. Utilizing exothermic technology where iron powder reacts with oxygen to generate gentle 40-45°C heat for 10-15 minutes, these masks simultaneously improve blood circulation and moisturize the delicate eye area. Popular among office workers, frequent travelers, and skincare enthusiasts, they've become a staple in modern wellness routines by combining convenience with therapeutic benefits.
As digital device usage soars globally—with average screen time exceeding 7 hours daily in many countries—the demand for effective eye care solutions continues climbing. What began as niche beauty products in Japan have evolved into sophisticated wellness tools featuring aromatherapy blends, temperature control, and eco-friendly designs.
